  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/upZiz61.png\" alt=\"煙囪積灰\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">新增<strong>紅磚、鵝卵石、石磚、泥磚、鐵、銅</strong>和<strong>陶土</strong>煙囪，會散發煙霧粒子。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H4YUooO.png\" alt=\"特色\" width=\"1000\" height=\"774\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">「煙囪積灰」在一個影片中被<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Boodlyneck\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boodlyneck</a>&nbsp;展示（於<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ICobJ1QU598&amp;t=293s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">4:52</a>處）：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ICobJ1QU598?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">•</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在 Fabric 1.20 及以下版本遊玩？這裡有一個移植版本：</span>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sooty Chimneys for Fabric</a> 由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/otomir23/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">otomir23</a> 製作&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜歡這個模組嗎？您的支持將讓我能夠繼續開發它以及其他模組！</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"108\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">看看我的其他模組：</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"曝光\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"信封\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"粉筆\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"貨物\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"單一銀行\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"小偷\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"鹽\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"學者\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"騎馬者\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
